      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but honestly it feels a little too brief for a \"comprehensive\" overview. since we're dealing with so many reviews, i really need more depth to satisfy the stakeholders. \n\nthe current summary is only about 85 words. can you expand on this? try to go much more in-depth for each point—get into the specifics of what users are saying about the hardware vs the software, the battery, the camera, etc. \n\njust remember: i need more detail and substance, not just repetitive sentences. i want a much more thorough, long-form report that really captures the nuance, but please keep it professional and avoid padding it with useless junk.",
